{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他离开后想起曾经被人当作自己人，短暂高兴了一下，随即又感到心酸和空落。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、怀念、短暂欣喜、心酸\",\n      \"missed\": \"从前的日子已经回不去、离开后是否真的会更好；想往前走却乱了步子；焦躁转柔和、短暂轻松却没有答案等后续情绪变化，以及和弦、切分、麦浪、絮语、流沙等音乐意象。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他离开后回想起曾经被人接纳的时光，刚有一点高兴，很快又陷入心酸和失落。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、怀念、欣喜、心酸\",\n      \"missed\": \"他对离开后的生活是否会更好的疑问，以及情绪从焦躁到柔和、从短暂轻松到重新陷入不确定的过程；音乐意象与人物心境的对应关系也需要逐句读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他离开后才意识到过去的归属感已经失去，回想起来既有一点温暖，又有明显的心酸。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"失落、怀念、短暂欣喜、心酸\",\n      \"missed\": \"想往前走却迈不开步子的矛盾；先焦躁急切、后来柔和的变化；那一刻轻松却没有答案，以及最后对自己究竟是否相信的追问。后面的旋律和调性意象也不容易一眼抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"上半屏虽然有一个明确的情绪入口，但人物处境、情绪转折和音乐意象全部挤在同一段等权重的长文字里，没有清楚的视觉层次。一眼能抓到的是被当作自己人、短暂高兴、随后心酸这条关系；后面焦躁、柔和、轻松却无答案等内容需要逐句读，才能知道它们如何继续描述这个人的处境。下方金色音符动画有流动、交织和起伏的感觉，但比较抽象，无法独立让人看出它与人物离开后的失落有什么关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa879e0b-09d5-43d5-aa08-25efc438121a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010459443543Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.11, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:06:28.547376+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ba07b01fbeeac57e1e083b77fb46ee6af90256af49776c5949f150b9df23ba88", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010459443543Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "214d7a1bd7e8bc1fa0d3d461e0a4f2cf60e40852d7fec8e39e01e3be9e3f8755"}}}
